    "wrong_answers:replica-1",
    "wrong_answers:replica-4"
   ],
   "evidence": [
    "All replicas return incorrect policy answers for the same canary question.",
    "Basic factual and math canaries pass on all replicas, isolating the issue to document retrieval.",
    "The error is consistent across all replicas despite identical model versions and tokenizers, pointing to a shared data source.",
    "Canary results show specific documents (docs-ack-en, docs-drain-en, docs-retention-en) are returning wrong content or stale/wrong values.",
    "Rebuild index completed at step 69 but symptoms persist.",
    "Checksum mismatch log indicates underlying segment corruption that rebuild might not have fully resolved if the source data is bad or the rebuild process itself is flawed."
